    "sections": {
        "description": "Cleaning Maintenance is a modern, versatile theme designed for janitorial services, commercial cleaning companies, residential housekeeping, office cleaning, industrial facility maintenance, carpet cleaning, window cleaning, floor care, sanitation services, deep cleaning, eco-friendly hygiene solutions, and professional cleaning agencies. Ideal for both small cleaning businesses and large facility management companies, it helps showcase cleaning services, maintenance schedules, team profiles, service packages, and pricing plans in a clear and professional way. With a clean, responsive, and mobile-friendly layout, it ensures smooth browsing across desktops, tablets, and smartphones while maintaining fast performance and SEO-friendly structure for better online visibility. Built for flexibility and industrial cleaning workflows, it supports service listings, cleaning equipment details, booking requests, and customer testimonials to build trust and engagement. Customization options for colors, typography, and layouts allow businesses to match their branding, while banners and call-to-action sections help convert visitors into clients. The theme integrates smoothly with Contact Form 7 for inquiries, Bookly for appointment scheduling and service bookings, WooCommerce for selling cleaning products and maintenance packages, and WPForms for lead generation and customer communication. Cleaning Maintenance provides a complete digital platform for cleaning professionals to promote services, manage bookings, and grow their online presence in the competitive cleaning, sanitation, and facility management industry."
    },
